---
source: crates/easyplay/src/cli.rs
expression: cmd.render_help().to_string()
---
Add a program to the library

Usage: easyplay add [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  The program

Options:
      --name <NAME>      Name of the game
  -v, --verbose...       Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
      --preset <PRESET>  Protection preset [possible values: offline, online, standard]
      --no-launch        Do not launch after adding
  -h, --help             Print help (see more with '--help')
